    "description": {
      "value": "<div data-ft-phase5-vocab-scrub=\"v1\" style=\"display:none\"></div>\n<p><em>“On my count, you’re going to be brilliant.”</em></p><p>As a <strong>bonus action</strong>, you can mark one ally within <strong>6 squares</strong> who can see or hear you.</p><ul><li>Before the start of your next turn, that ally may add your <strong>tier</strong> to <strong>one attribute check</strong> they make.</li><li>They decide to apply the bonus after seeing the roll but before the GM announces the result.</li><li>You can use this feature a number of times equal to your <strong>tier</strong>, and you regain all expended uses when you finish a Soma Break.</li></ul><p><em>You don’t change what they can do. You change when they believe they can do it.</em></p>",
      "chat": ""
    },
